<p class="sub-head">Certified Settings checkbox</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">When this option is enabled all settings in the tab are set to their default values. For the best results, it is recommended to use 'Certified settings'.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">When all changes are made, confirm with <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'</b></span><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Apply'</b></span> button.</p>

